  "description": "The annual average fell from 375,000 in 2000 to 247,000 in 2025. Thin line: original quarterly estimates. Thick line: complete-year averages. Latest quarter: about 245,900 in February 2026. This counts the agriculture industry, not just the farmer occupation."
